        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am now fairly certain that 'mini.deps' will be more or less replaced with `vim.pack` (when it is more stable). So I'd like to keep 'mini.deps' functionality regarding plugin management (install/update/delete) as frozen. So closing this as (I hope) not planned.",
